From: Marionette AirDrop driver research
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] preserve associated STA for a bounded monitor RX test

Management RX still has no AWDL at WMI, even with the scan receive-filter
request. Exercise the existing monitor receive datapath while retaining the
STA association. A root load-time gate defaults off. Existing concurrency
checks remain. Only skip the explicit software disconnect for an already
associated STA; monitor channel requests must exactly match the STA primary
frequency and width. No RAW TX is enabled and no radio is retuned here.
Firmware behavior and stability remain unverified; this is not a published
coexistence solution. Test only with USB capture and independent stock rollback.

